    "updated_at": "2016-08-03T00:28:18Z",
    "body": "The problem is that then `new Element(\"p\")` would not return an `Element`. So this is unlikely to ever work. We may in the future allow `new HTMLParagraphElement()`, but probably not ever `new Element(\"tagname\")`.\n",
